Rule                  Proto  Src        SrcPort  SrcVLAN  SrcVRF      Dst             DstPort  DstVLAN  DstVRF      Action
management/Allow_SSH  TCP    0.0.0.0/0  *        0        management  192.168.0.0/16  22       0        management  allow

